# `compact compile` writes into compiler/contract/keys/zkir subdirs when
# invoked directly against circuits/static/wallet-registry/. The committed
# artifacts (`register.{bzkir,prover,verifier,zkir}`) live flat under the
# directory and are force-tracked past the global `*.bzkir`/`*.prover`/
# `*.verifier` ignore (precedent: wallet-attestation).
